RATIONALE
---------

The copyleft in this project is structural rather than ideological. It is the
legal mechanism that prevents a manufacturer from shipping a locked-down build
of a watch, a car or a pair of glasses in which the operator has lost the
ability to see, revoke and refuse. The architecture enforces user sovereignty
technically; this licence makes it defensible legally. Neither is sufficient
alone.
